    <item>
      <title>Developer Onboarding Guide</title>
      <link>https://info-tech-io.github.io/open-source/onboarding/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 23 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://info-tech-io.github.io/open-source/onboarding/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;developer-onboarding-guide&#34; class=link_owner&gt;&#xA;  Developer Onboarding Guide&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#developer-onboarding-guide&#34; class=&#34;link icon&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;svg&gt;&#xA;      &lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#anchor-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to InfoTech.io! This comprehensive guide will help you get started as a contributor to our open source educational technology ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;-quick-start-5-minutes&#34; class=link_owner&gt;&#xA;  🎯 Quick Start (5 Minutes)&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#-quick-start-5-minutes&#34; class=&#34;link icon&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;svg&gt;&#xA;      &lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#anchor-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;step-1-choose-your-interest&#34; class=link_owner&gt;&#xA;  Step 1: Choose Your Interest&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#step-1-choose-your-interest&#34; class=&#34;link icon&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;svg&gt;&#xA;      &lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#anchor-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Educational Content&lt;/strong&gt;: Create courses, lessons, and learning materials&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Development&lt;/strong&gt;: Work on INFOTEKA platform features&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;: Improve Hugo Templates Factory, Quiz Engine, Web Terminal&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tools &amp;amp; Automation&lt;/strong&gt;: Enhance InfoTech CLI and development workflows&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;step-2-set-up-your-environment&#34; class=link_owner&gt;&#xA;  Step 2: Set Up Your Environment&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#step-2-set-up-your-environment&#34; class=&#34;link icon&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;svg&gt;&#xA;      &lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#anchor-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;# 1. Fork and clone a repository&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/REPO_NAME.git&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;cd REPO_NAME&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;# 2. Install dependencies (varies by project)&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;npm install        &lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;# For JavaScript projects&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;pip install -r requirements.txt  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;# For Python projects&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;step-3-make-your-first-contribution&#34; class=link_owner&gt;&#xA;  Step 3: Make Your First Contribution&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#step-3-make-your-first-contribution&#34; class=&#34;link icon&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;svg&gt;&#xA;      &lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#anchor-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Find a &amp;ldquo;good first issue&amp;rdquo; label in any repository&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Comment that you&amp;rsquo;d like to work on it&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Create a branch: &lt;code&gt;git checkout -b fix/issue-description&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Make your changes and test them&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Submit a pull request with a clear description&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;-detailed-onboarding-process&#34; class=link_owner&gt;&#xA;  📋 Detailed Onboarding Process&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#-detailed-onboarding-process&#34; class=&#34;link icon&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;svg&gt;&#xA;      &lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#anchor-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;phase-1-understanding-the-ecosystem-week-1&#34; class=link_owner&gt;&#xA;  Phase 1: Understanding the Ecosystem (Week 1)&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#phase-1-understanding-the-ecosystem-week-1&#34; class=&#34;link icon&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;svg&gt;&#xA;      &lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#anchor-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 id=&#34;day-1-2-system-overview&#34; class=link_owner&gt;&#xA;  Day 1-2: System Overview&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#day-1-2-system-overview&#34; class=&#34;link icon&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;svg&gt;&#xA;      &lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#anchor-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Read Foundation Documents&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Technical Architecture</title>
      <link>https://info-tech-io.github.io/open-source/architecture/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 23 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://info-tech-io.github.io/open-source/architecture/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;infotechio-technical-architecture&#34; class=link_owner&gt;&#xA;  InfoTech.io Technical Architecture&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#infotechio-technical-architecture&#34; class=&#34;link icon&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;svg&gt;&#xA;      &lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#anchor-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This document provides a comprehensive overview of InfoTech.io&amp;rsquo;s technical architecture, design decisions, and implementation details for developers and contributors.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;-system-overview&#34; class=link_owner&gt;&#xA;  🏗️ System Overview&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#-system-overview&#34; class=&#34;link icon&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;svg&gt;&#xA;      &lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#anchor-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;InfoTech.io implements a &lt;strong&gt;decentralized, modular architecture&lt;/strong&gt; based on the &amp;ldquo;Hub and Spoke&amp;rdquo; pattern with static site generation and automated CI/CD pipelines.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;high-level-architecture&#34; class=link_owner&gt;&#xA;  High-Level Architecture&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#high-level-architecture&#34; class=&#34;link icon&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;svg&gt;&#xA;      &lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#anchor-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-mermaid&#34; data-lang=&#34;mermaid&#34;&gt;graph TB&#xA;    subgraph &amp;#34;Content Layer&amp;#34;&#xA;        A[Educational Modules]&#xA;        B[Corporate Content]&#xA;        C[Documentation]&#xA;    end&#xA;&#xA;    subgraph &amp;#34;Build Layer&amp;#34;&#xA;        D[Hugo Templates Factory]&#xA;        E[Quiz Engine]&#xA;        F[Web Terminal]&#xA;    end&#xA;&#xA;    subgraph &amp;#34;Automation Layer&amp;#34;&#xA;        G[GitHub Actions]&#xA;        H[InfoTech CLI]&#xA;        I[Webhook System]&#xA;    end&#xA;&#xA;    subgraph &amp;#34;Infrastructure Layer&amp;#34;&#xA;        J[Apache2 Server]&#xA;        K[DNS &amp;amp; SSL]&#xA;        L[CDN Ready]&#xA;    end&#xA;&#xA;    A --&amp;gt; D&#xA;    B --&amp;gt; D&#xA;    C --&amp;gt; D&#xA;    D --&amp;gt; G&#xA;    E --&amp;gt; D&#xA;    F --&amp;gt; J&#xA;    G --&amp;gt; J&#xA;    H --&amp;gt; G&#xA;    I --&amp;gt; G&#xA;    J --&amp;gt; K&#xA;    K --&amp;gt; L&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;-core-architectural-principles&#34; class=link_owner&gt;&#xA;  🎯 Core Architectural Principles&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#-core-architectural-principles&#34; class=&#34;link icon&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;svg&gt;&#xA;      &lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#anchor-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;1-modular-design&#34; class=link_owner&gt;&#xA;  1. Modular Design&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#1-modular-design&#34; class=&#34;link icon&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;svg&gt;&#xA;      &lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#anchor-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Each component is independent and can be developed, tested, and deployed separately:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Contributing Guide</title>
      <link>https://info-tech-io.github.io/open-source/contributing/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 23 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://info-tech-io.github.io/open-source/contributing/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;contributing-to-infotechio&#34; class=link_owner&gt;&#xA;  Contributing to InfoTech.io&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#contributing-to-infotechio&#34; class=&#34;link icon&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;svg&gt;&#xA;      &lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#anchor-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Thank you for your interest in contributing to InfoTech.io! This guide provides detailed information on how to contribute effectively to our open source educational technology ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;-quick-contribution-guide&#34; class=link_owner&gt;&#xA;  🎯 Quick Contribution Guide&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#-quick-contribution-guide&#34; class=&#34;link icon&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;svg&gt;&#xA;      &lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#anchor-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;first-time-contributors&#34; class=link_owner&gt;&#xA;  First Time Contributors&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#first-time-contributors&#34; class=&#34;link icon&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;svg&gt;&#xA;      &lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#anchor-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Read our &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/info-tech-io/.github/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md&#34;&gt;Code of Conduct&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/orgs/info-tech-io/discussions&#34;&gt;GitHub Discussions&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Find a &amp;ldquo;good first issue&amp;rdquo;&lt;/strong&gt; in any repository&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Follow our &lt;a href=&#34;https://info-tech-io.github.io/open-source/onboarding/&#34;&gt;Developer Onboarding Guide&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;experienced-contributors&#34; class=link_owner&gt;&#xA;  Experienced Contributors&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#experienced-contributors&#34; class=&#34;link icon&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;svg&gt;&#xA;      &lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#anchor-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Review current &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/orgs/info-tech-io/projects&#34;&gt;Project Boards&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Participate in &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/orgs/info-tech-io/discussions/categories/architecture&#34;&gt;Architecture Discussions&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Propose new features&lt;/strong&gt; via GitHub Issues&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor newcomers&lt;/strong&gt; in the community&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;-types-of-contributions&#34; class=link_owner&gt;&#xA;  📋 Types of Contributions&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#-types-of-contributions&#34; class=&#34;link icon&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;svg&gt;&#xA;      &lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#anchor-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;1-educational-content&#34; class=link_owner&gt;&#xA;  1. Educational Content&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#1-educational-content&#34; class=&#34;link icon&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;svg&gt;&#xA;      &lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#anchor-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help create and improve learning materials&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Issue and Commit Workflow Guide</title>
      <link>https://info-tech-io.github.io/open-source/issue-commit-workflow/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 02 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://info-tech-io.github.io/open-source/issue-commit-workflow/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;issue-and-commit-workflow-complete-guide&#34; class=link_owner&gt;&#xA;  Issue and Commit Workflow: Complete Guide&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#issue-and-commit-workflow-complete-guide&#34; class=&#34;link icon&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;svg&gt;&#xA;      &lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#anchor-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;-overview&#34; class=link_owner&gt;&#xA;  📖 Overview&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#-overview&#34; class=&#34;link icon&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;svg&gt;&#xA;      &lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#anchor-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This comprehensive guide describes the complete workflow for managing changes in InfoTech.io projects, from opening an Issue to merging code. It provides detailed, step-by-step instructions with practical examples, diagrams, and templates.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;why-this-process-exists&#34; class=link_owner&gt;&#xA;  Why This Process Exists&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#why-this-process-exists&#34; class=&#34;link icon&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;svg&gt;&#xA;      &lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#anchor-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Problem&lt;/strong&gt;: Without a structured process, development becomes chaotic:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Unclear what&amp;rsquo;s being worked on and why&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Difficult to review architectural decisions before implementation&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Hard to track progress and understand project history&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Challenging for maintainers to evaluate contributions&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Solution&lt;/strong&gt;: Documentation-as-Code approach:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
  </channel>
